# Customer App Rule

This rule documents the architecture, features, and implementation details for the Mozome Customer App.

## Scope

- Applies to: `app/` directory and related files.

## Topics

- Clean Architecture structure for the customer app
- State management with Bloc
- Navigation and routing
- Dependency injection and configuration
- UI features and user experience
- Testing and best practices

## Key Features

- User authentication and profile management
- Service discovery and browsing
- Booking and scheduling services
- Service provider ratings and reviews
- Payment processing and wallet management
- Chat with service providers
- Notifications and reminders

## Implementation Guidelines

- Follow Clean Architecture principles with strict layer separation
- Use BLoC pattern for state management
- Implement smooth onboarding flow
- Create accessible and user-friendly interfaces
- Support offline mode where appropriate
- Optimize performance for varying network conditions
- Implement comprehensive error handling and recovery

